# Agent B - I18n Theme Hardening Log

Status: complete

Subagent: Euler.

Findings:

- `src\renderer\lib\i18n.ts` and `src\renderer\lib\theme.ts` were missing.
- Static app only stored one state blob and did not persist `agentflow.language` / `agentflow.theme`.
- Static settings lacked a dedicated `界面偏好 / Interface Preferences` section.
- Static CSS lacked explicit `[data-theme="light"]` and `prefers-color-scheme` coverage.

Implemented:

- Added static `translations` with `zh` and `en`, plus `t(key)`.
- Added topbar language toggle showing `English` in Chinese mode and `中文` in English mode.
- Added topbar three-state theme cycle and persisted `agentflow.theme`.
- Added settings Interface Preferences with Language, Theme, Current language, and Current theme.
- Added React `i18n.ts`, `theme.ts`, language toggle, and migrated theme storage to `agentflow.theme`.
- Added `[data-theme="light"]`, `[data-theme="dark"]`, and `prefers-color-scheme`.

